    {
      "id": "claim_b1839e18453d4892aa9923882d886204",
      "statement": "Artifacts flow raw CSV -> Pandera contract -> prepare_data (reference.parquet and production_base.parquet) -> training (models/baseline.joblib plus MLflow) -> simulated production_drift.parquet -> Evidently drift reports and alerts and score-impact JSON -> a .prom file consumed by node-exporter, Prometheus and Grafana. The README's stated context is a fintech credit-scoring model whose reliability must be sustained under distribution shift, and docs/architecture.md still sketches an API stage that is not implemented.",
