    {
      "id": "claim_db5d994e92524ea5a7e6036303510ccf",
      "statement": "Training (src/training/train.py main) re-validates reference.parquet with the training contract, then in MLflow experiment credit-scoring-baseline (run baseline-xgboost) fits the sklearn/XGBoost pipeline on a stratified 20% hold-out split, computes overall AUC, KS, PR-AUC, best-F1 threshold, F1, FPR, FNR and recall, and reuses that threshold to compute group metrics (AUC, FPR, FNR, recall) per gender (F/M only) and age band (lt30, 30_44, 45_59, 60_plus); group AUC is skipped for groups with fewer than 30 positives. It logs params, overall and group metrics and the model to MLflow, and save_model writes the joblib model and a metrics JSON of the overall metrics only, whose threshold is later used for score-impact analysis.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/models/baseline.py#L66-L85",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:af8e98d0bce8bce4cfd467928061f3a1459ce67361b92c7dc8569d00187be738:"
